{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33637","headline":"自叹 · 邵谒","name":"自叹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春蚕未成茧，已贺箱笼实。\n蟢子徒有丝，终年不成匹。\n每念古人言，有得则有失。\n我命独如何，憔悴长如一。\n白日九衢中，幽独暗如漆。\n流泉有枯时，穷贱无尽日。\n惆怅复惆怅，几回新月出。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"邵谒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33637.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33637","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}